UPDATE companies SET description='Illinois Iron Inc. operates from Rockford, Illinois, where it was founded in 1998 as a modest welding operation. The company has grown over two decades into a recognized architectural metal fabricator serving the Midwest and beyond.

The shop specializes in custom architectural metalwork, producing precision-crafted railings, cladding, trim, stair components, countertops, bar fronts, wall cladding, screens, partitions, signage, and storefront elements. In-house capabilities include welding, powder coating, and a range of finish options such as patinas, brushed metals, and custom coatings, allowing end-to-end control from raw material to finished piece.

Its customer base includes architects, builders, designers, and millwork firms on commercial, hospitality, and public-space projects. Notable installations include the PNC Building in downtown Chicago for millwork partner Bernhard WoodWork, as well as restaurants, hotels, and retail storefronts across Illinois.

The company states its founding mission was to deliver precision-engineered metalwork that elevates architectural design while standing the test of time, rooted in honest communication, superior craftsmanship, and dedication to customer satisfaction. Expanded finish capabilities now enable full end-to-end solutions aligned with design intent.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Architectural finishes (patinas, brushed metals, custom coatings)", "Powder coating (in-house)", "Millwork collaboration", "Precision welding", "Stair railings fabrication", "Countertop and bar front fabrication", "Wall cladding fabrication", "Screen and partition fabrication", "Signage and decorative element fabrication", "Storefront metalwork fabrication"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Hospitality", "Custom architectural projects", "Millwork", "Architects", "Builders", "Designers", "Restaurants", "Hotels", "Storefronts", "Public spaces"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house powder coating and finishing", "Responsive quotes and fast lead times", "Built-to-spec, design-aligned results", "20+ years of industry experience", "Collaborative process with millwork partners"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1998 -> /about", "Headquarters at 2401 11th Street, Rockford, IL -> /", "Custom architectural metal fabrication including railings, cladding, trim, stair components, countertops, bar fronts, wall cladding, screens, partitions, signage, storefront metalwork -> /services", "In-house powder coating and finishing capabilities -> /services", "Finish options: patinas, brushed metals, custom coatings -> /services", "Collaborative process with millwork partners -> /services", "Serves commercial, hospitality, custom architectural projects -> /about", "Customers include architects, builders, designers, millwork firms -> /about", "Project example: PNC Building Downtown Chicago for Bernhard WoodWork -> /", "20+ years of industry experience -> /", "Responsive quotes and fast lead times -> /", "Built-to-spec, design-aligned results -> /", "Mission: deliver precision-engineered metalwork that elevates architectural design -> /about", "Values: honest communication, superior craftsmanship, dedication to customer satisfaction -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Illinois Iron Inc brings over two decades of precision metalwork to commercial, hospitality, and custom architectural projects.", "founded_year": "1998", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='illinois-iron-inc-architectural-metals-rails-fences-custom-fabrication' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Illinois Solar is based in Moline, Illinois, and serves residential and commercial customers across Northwest Illinois, North Central Illinois, and the greater Quad Cities area. The company specializes in solar energy system design and installation, along with complementary services such as battery backup storage, electric vehicle charger installation, and solar panel cleaning and snow removal.

Its service portfolio covers custom solar panel design and installation, backup battery storage systems that store excess solar energy for use during outages, EV charging station installation for homes and businesses, and ongoing maintenance including panel cleaning and snow removal to maintain peak production. The company handles projects from initial planning through installation and long-term support.

Illinois Solar works with homeowners and business owners seeking to reduce electricity costs and increase energy independence. Its customer base spans residential properties and commercial facilities throughout its service territory in western Illinois.

