UPDATE companies SET description='Ilumen Solar is a locally owned solar installation company based in Lake Barrington, Illinois, serving the northwest Chicago suburbs. Founded in 2016 by Zach Witt, a Barrington native and NABCEP-certified Technical Sales Professional, the business began with a community-first mindset: “if we don’t start a solar business here then we’d be doing a disservice to the community.” Witt, a Montana State University graduate, also serves on the Barrington Area Chamber of Commerce board and mentors high school business students.

The company provides turnkey solar solutions for residential and commercial customers, including rooftop panel installation, battery backup, critter guards, electrical upgrades, EV charging, combined solar-and-roofing projects, inverter monitoring, and SREC management. A three-person core team—Witt, operations manager Dan, and project coordinator Austin—handles site assessment, design, procurement, and post-installation monitoring. Drone flights are conducted before proposals to ensure accurate production estimates.

Ilumen Solar works with homeowners, business owners, and “stranded” solar customers left without support from original installers. Reviews cite projects ranging from shaded residential properties requiring creative outbuilding mounting to commercial arrays, though specific client names are not disclosed. The firm also assists with Illinois incentive applications such as Illinois Shines.

Witt started the company to bring high-quality, aesthetically focused solar to the area. Differentiators include pre-contract site visits with drone surveys, meticulous design that hides conduit in attics, a preference for North American-sourced equipment, and financing without hidden dealer fees. The company emphasizes local presence, community involvement, and long-term service for systems built to last 25-plus years.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation (residential)", "Solar panel installation (commercial)", "Battery backup installation", "Critter guard installation", "Electrical service upgrades", "EV charging station installation", "Solar and roofing integration", "Inverter monitoring and management", "SREC management", "Solar and battery generator kits", "Code compliance services"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Drone technology for site assessment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Pre-contract site visits and drone surveys for accurate production estimates", "Meticulous design with conduit hidden in attics where possible", "Equipment sourced primarily from North America", "Financing with no hidden dealer fees", "Locally owned and operated in Barrington, IL"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2016 by Zach Witt in Barrington, IL -> /about", "Zach Witt is NABCEP Technical Sales Professional certified -> /about", "Core team includes Zach Witt (owner), Dan (Operations Manager), Austin (project coordinator) -> /about", "Services: residential/commercial solar, battery backup, critter guards, electrical upgrades, EV charging, solar & roofing, inverter monitoring, SREC management, solar & battery generator kits -> /about, /services", "Differentiators: pre-contract site visits with drone surveys, meticulous design hiding conduit, North American-sourced equipment, no hidden dealer fees -> /about", "Locally owned, member of Barrington Area Chamber of Commerce -> /about", "Headquarters: Lake Barrington, Illinois -> db", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "ilumen Solar is a premier commercial and residential solar installer in the NW Chicago suburbs.", "founded_year": "2016", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/ilumensolar/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ilumen-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Imagination Fabrication, LLC was established in 2009 by Nick Spring in Apex, North Carolina. The company began as a provider of metal fabrication, installation, and commercial truck repair services for customers throughout the Raleigh–Durham metro area, including Apex, Cary, Durham, Raleigh, Holly Springs, Garner, and surrounding communities.

The shop offers custom welding, metal fabrication, CNC plasma cutting, equipment repair, and wheel repair, with mobile welding services that bring equipment to the job site. Capabilities extend to entrance gate construction, dumpster door fabrication, restaurant equipment fabrication and repair, custom bumper and rack building, frame and roll‑cage work, and fuel tank fabrication and repair. The company also stocks a range of metal supplies for contractors and DIYers.

Clients include commercial truck operators needing diesel repairs, restaurants requiring custom equipment, property owners seeking gates and railings, and contractors sourcing metal materials. Projects have ranged from custom art pieces to structural roll cages and fuel tanks, serving the construction, transportation, food‑service, and residential markets in central North Carolina.

